OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill see showers, most frequent across
OL,7,FArgyll. Then showers becoming fewer
OL,8,Fand lighter during the early hours.
OL,9,FStrong westerly winds easing down
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FAfter a dry start rain will
OL,13,Fspread east from late morning and
OL,14,Fduring the afternoon. Rain turning
OL,15,Flight and patchy by evening.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,18,Fand windy with a few showers on
OL,19,FMonday, strong westerly winds. Dry for
OL,20,Fmost of Sunday, rain likely later.
OL,21,FEarly rain on Monday then dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
